.TH MARK-SHOT-CODE-SCAN 1 "August 2026" "Mark Shot 0.1.49" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mark-shot-code-scan \- decode barcodes and QR codes for Mark Shot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/libexec/mark-shot/mark-shot-code-scan
.RB [ \-\-format
.BR json ]
.I image
.SH DESCRIPTION
Decodes supported codes from an image and prints results and positions as JSON.
It tries zxing-cpp, pyzbar, and OpenCV backends in that order.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MARK_SHOT_CODE_SCAN_PYTHON
Python interpreter in a user-managed scanner virtual environment.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mark-shot (1)
